Authority: the product owner's 2026-11-01 21:41:12 AEDT instruction, verbatim: "please use as many agents necessary to work through tickets and backlog for HPSM-POC, Security Composer and MPS Calculator". His HPSM-POC rule of 2026-11-01: **Done means merged to main, each ticket's done-when checked first; nothing deploys.** **You do NOT merge, deploy, run `az`, open, edit or comment on a PR, write to Jira, touch `main` or any other branch, rebase, amend, reset or force-push. No HTTP to any hosted, UAT, demo or production site. Nothing deploys.** You push ONE new branch (step 12) and nothing else.

